    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After more than two years of state pressure, the regime's gatekeepers have moved to financially destroy their target, the powerful tech giant Google. Dismissing all compromise proposals from the parent company, they are now finalizing a crushing blow—a substantial fine expected before their August recess. This is not just a new penalty, but part of a decade-long war of attrition by the state, adding to a relentless persecution campaign against Alphabet.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
